			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Expand funding acknowledgements section in README\n\nEnhance the Funding & Acknowledgements section of the Cocoon README with a structured overview of the project's supporting organizations. Add a dedicated `<thead>` row calling out Land, PlayForm, NLnet, and the NGI0 Commons Fund alongside their respective logo cells, include a descriptive preamble explaining Land's mission as an NGI0-funded open-source project, and link to the official NLnet project page.\n\nMinor formatting improvements: collapse the LICENSE link onto a single line, rephrase the changelog call-to-action to be more inviting, and normalize the Land logo URL to lowercase (`editor.land`).\n\nThis provides clearer attribution to funding partners and aligns the document with the project's public-facing narrative.",
